# Native binaries (.so files) — too large for git history (~500MB total).
# These ARE shipped in the npm tarball (see package.json `files` field +
# .npmignore keeping `android/` in the published package) but live in
# the release artifacts rather than the source repo. To re-distribute on
# npm install, you'll add a postinstall hook later (Phase 49+); for now,
# the binaries exist locally and the tarball will pick them up.
android/src/main/jniLibs/

